SUMMARY:CHECK: IEEE membership - 2028 dues are charged automatically (cover
  runs to 31 Dec 2027)
DESCRIPTION:IEEE student membership. Joined 16 Sep 2026, US$27 student rate
 , and by IEEE's own window rule (applications 16 Aug to 28 Feb are process
 ed as the FOLLOWING year's full-year membership, services start immediatel
 y) this covers the 2027 membership year through 31 December 2027. So nothi
 ng needs paying by hand - and ==automatic renewal is ON==: opted in 16 Sep
  2026 ("At the beginning of each membership year\, you will automatically 
