 r before the card is charged. Card on file is a MasterCard\; the 16 Sep 20
 26 order was the US$27.00 student rate. Read this entry as a CHECK that th
 e 2028 charge went through and that the card is still valid - or as the mo
 ment to switch automatic renewal off in the IEEE account if you would rath
 er pay each year. If the charge fails\, cover ends 31 Dec 2027. Renew for 
 the 2028 year before 28 February 2028 to keep it continuous; after that da
 te a lapsed member rejoins under the half-year window instead. Student rat
 e is good for up to eight cumulative years. Renew at ieee.org -> Sign In -
