UID:b9e30407f2f4454cb8d42a9b14759bb4@hkmu
DTSTAMP:20261015T100000Z
DTSTART;TZID=Asia/Hong_Kong:20261018T140000
DTEND;TZID=Asia/Hong_Kong:20261018T160000
SUMMARY:Kitty + programmer call - Sunday afternoon (TIME TBC)
DESCRIPTION:Kitty's diabetic foot screening project: call with Kitty and th
 e programmer she mentioned. AFTERNOON\, EXACT TIME NOT CONFIRMED: ask Kitt
 y. Purpose from his side is to learn how the software side works so the ha
 rdware fits it\, not to present or commit. Five questions for the programm
 er: what runs on the device versus the cloud\; what language and framework
  and whether code already exists\; how the device talks to the software (B
 luetooth\, serial\, Wi-Fi\, HTTP) and at what data rate\; what the softwar
 e needs the hardware to produce and in what format\; and where measurement
 s go\, who can see them\, and what must stay on the device for privacy. Fo
 ur asks for Kitty in the same call: a schedule of his pre-existing work so
  it stays his\; the IP assignment limited to credited deliverables with a 
 credit line\; the non-compete narrowed or dropped\; and a mutual or capped
  indemnity. Bring back the Sham Shui Po screening time for Tue 20 Oct and 
 the assessment modules. Prep note: Kitty plus the programmer — Sunday 18
  Oct call prep.
END:VEVENT
