SUMMARY:COMP 3500SEF A1 - draft the MIL specification (1200 words)
DESCRIPTION:COMP 3500SEF Assignment 1 (Requirement Engineering). Draft the 
 MIL Insurance Claim App specification\, not more than 1200 words\, written
  independently. Word budget: introduction and scope 120\, purpose and glos
 sary 80\, stakeholders 100\, functional requirements 400\, non-functional 
 requirements 250 classified as product\, organisational and external\, dom
 ain requirements 120 on PDPO and retention\, interfaces and data 100\, con
 straints and assumptions 80\, acceptance and open questions 50. Structure 
 it on the Lecture 4 document structure with the Mentcare document as the m
 odel. Local writing\, so the OLE outage does not matter. Remaining after t
 his block: finalise the PDF\, write the reflection of 1000 characters\, co
 nfirm the evidence link opens for a stranger\, and find the MS Form link. 
 Note: Assignment 1 - Requirement Engineering (the brief and the plan).
END:VEVENT
